{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_5e7dbafdc0e5c8fb","item_id":"slot_5e7dbafdc0e5c8fb#1","text":"海外企业把传统标箔的量往高端放了，出现缺口，国内传统标箔企业加工费才涨了一点","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_9cb1bda27365","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"就是因为海外企业把传统标箔的量往高端放了，出现缺口，国内传统标箔企业加工费才涨了一点。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_7a4e2a0c2c19f7a3","item_id":"slot_7a4e2a0c2c19f7a3#1","text":"还有两个小问题","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_105b7d8129c8","polarity":"affirmed","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"还有两个小问题。","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_e6378367e2b1f0a1","item_id":"slot_e6378367e2b1f0a1#1","text":"第一个，我们做钛电极好像是耗材，每年都要更换，存量设备往上走，这个产品是不是比较好的生意","semantic_type":"question","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_105b7d8129c8","polarity":"unknown","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"第一个，我们做钛电极好像是耗材，每年都要更换，存量设备往上走，这个产品是不是比较好的生意？","unknown_fields":[]}
{"record_type":"item","candidate_slot_id":"slot_f7d13415560f1be0","item_id":"slot_f7d13415560f1be0#1","text":"第二个，体系内还有一家叫塞尔电子材料的，做陶瓷外壳什么的，您知道那个公司的定位吗","semantic_type":"question","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"quoted_other","speaker_ref":"spk_105b7d8129c8","polarity":"unknown","value":null,"behavior_status":null,"temporal_frame":"contemporaneous","evidence_quote":"第二个，体系内还有一家叫塞尔电子材料的，做陶瓷外壳什么的，您知道那个公司的定位吗？","unknown_fields":[]}
